CLASSIFY_PROJECT.user_template:
Analyze the following project for R&D qualification:

```json
{project_json}
```

Respond with this exact JSON structure:
{
  "rd_score": <float 0.0-1.0, weighted average of criteria>,
  "is_rd_eligible": <boolean, true if rd_score >= 0.5>,
  "criteria_scores": {
    "novelty": { "score": <float>, "justification": "<string>" },
    "technical_uncertainty": { "score": <float>, "justification": "<string>" },
    "systematic_approach": { "score": <float>, "justification": "<string>" },
    "transferability": { "score": <float>, "justification": "<string>" },
    "creative_element": { "score": <float>, "justification": "<string>" }
  },
  "key_innovations": [
    "<string: concise description of each identified innovation>"
  ],
  "risk_flags": [
    "<string: any areas that may be challenged by tax authorities>"
  ],
  "recommended_evidence": [
    "<string: documentation the company should prepare>"
  ]
}

GENERATE_CLAIM_TEXT.user_template:
Generate a formal R&D tax credit claim justification based on the following data:

**Company Information:**
```json
{company_json}
```

**Qualifying Projects:**
```json
{projects_json}
```

**R&D Expenditure Summary:**
```json
{expenses_json}
```

**Country/Jurisdiction:** {country}

Respond with this exact JSON structure:
{
  "claim_text": {
    "company_overview": "<string: 2-3 paragraphs>",
    "project_descriptions": [
      {
        "project_title": "<string>",
        "objectives": "<string>",
        "methodology": "<string>",
        "technical_challenges": "<string>",
        "outcomes": "<string>"
      }
    ],
    "novelty_statement": "<string: 2-3 paragraphs on technological advancement>",
    "technical_uncertainty_statement": "<string: 2-3 paragraphs on unresolved technical challenges>",
    "expenditure_justification": "<string: summary of qualifying costs by category>"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "total_projects_analyzed": <int>,
    "qualifying_projects_count": <int>,
    "confidence_level": "<high|medium|low>",
    "warnings": ["<string: any concerns about the claim>"]
  }
}
